The krunkit fork of virglrenderer (0.10.4e-krunkit), its in-process Venus built for Windows
with clang-cl (shards' D202; scripts/gpu-libs applies it): the POSIX names it uses given
their UCRT twins (src/shards_win32.h, src/shards_compat), Vulkan's loader opened from
System32 rather than linked (src/shards_vulkan_win32.c: the loader's entry points the
renderer's objects leave undefined), blobs mapped by their pointers as on macOS, and every
allocation a guest may map made of pages the renderer allocates and its device imports
(VK_EXT_external_memory_host), which a blob holds until it goes.

